2.3 Weaknesses of LISA-LCWU: Pre-sustainability Experiments
• There is not any separate permanent position of LISA-LCWU coordinator. Coordinator is faculty member of Statistics department and her regular assignments are teaching, research and other many administrative duties being Chairperson. Before joining as chairperson, she was sole member organizing activities, maintain records, funds auditing etc. with the help of MS Statistics students. • Another weakness is related to funds that is equally important as blood for survival of human body. There is no financial support from university so activities (Workshops) in the past were conducted with the help of financial support from ISI or by charging nominal fee in the few workshops. • LISA-LCWU has no separate office where meetings with domain experts can be conducted.
3 Methodology: Sustainability Experiments of LISA-LCWU
Strategies to make LISA-LCWU sustainable are devised by keeping in view the local situation and seeking help from LISA 2020 network sustainability assessment document shared by global director LISA 2020 network and also reading success stories of labs in the article titled “Statistics and Data Science Collaboration Laboratories: Engines for Development” (Love et al., 2017). Multiple strategies (experiments) have been implemented to put LISA-LCWU on the sustainable path. Some were already used on limited scale and tried to extend and reinforce those on large scale. Timeline for experiment was from first January, 2022 to 30th September 2022.
3.1 Increase Visibility
It is the era of publicity and social networking so this strategy is given priority in the sustainability experiment to attract potential collaborators, to assist domain experts and also domain experts to bring their projects for data analysis. As Vance highlighted in his address at the 62nd World Statistics Congress of the International Statistical Institute, this is part of communication strategy and just as crucial as legs in the human body (Love et al., 2017). The following initiatives have been taken in this regard.
Webpage
Additionally, a great step was to generate the website page (https://www.lcwu.edu. pk/stat-lisa-lcwu.html) of LISA-LCWU on the LCWU website to enhance visibility. Five tabs are added at LISA-LCWU webpage that display LISA-LCWU, Mis


