3.5 LoI with University of Colorado Boulder and Lahore College for Women University, Lahore
The Department of Statistics at LCWU, Pakistan, and the Department of Applied Mathematics at CU Boulder, USA, have signed a Letter of Intent (LoI), which outlines the collaboration on LISA activities. This LoI is a legal document that strengthens the sustainability of LISA-LCWU by formalizing the collaboration between the two departments. As part of this collaboration, LISA 2020 at CU Boulder will provide guidance on the sustainability of LISA-LCWU, ensuring that it remains a vibrant and impactful laboratory for interdisciplinary statistical analysis.
