6 How Experiments Addressed the Challenges of Sustainability of LISA-LCWU?
Challenge 1
The extensive publicity strategy that was implemented played a vital role in establishing the reputation of LISA-LCWU and increasing its visibility. The improvement of the website’s content and the allocation of a furnished office with the LISA-LCWU nameplate helped to authenticate the organization’s affiliation with the university. This, in turn, helped to build trust between LISA-LCWU’s collaborators and domain experts.
Challenge 2
• Workload of managing LISA-LCWU has been distributed by engaging more members. It resulted in success i.e., increase in quarterly activities of LISALCWU. • Offering of monetary incentives to attract collaborators and resource person, are not done due to non-approval from competent authorities.
